              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuphumile emlonyeni wakho, kugcine, ukwenze; yebo, umnikelo wesihle, njengalokho ufunge isithembiso sakho kuJehova uNkulunkulu wakho, owasethembisa ngomlomo wakho.",
          "type": "text",
