        {
          "text": "Uma ungena ezinhlangeni ezingakavunwa zomakhelwane wakho, wokha izikhwebu ngesandla sakho; kodwa akumelwe uhlabe isikela ezinhlangeni zikamakhelwane wakho ezingakavunwa.",
